<!-- 5. ABSTRACT -->
<h1 class="page-break">ABSTRACT</h1>
<p>In modern collegiate education, manual management of student attendance registers, continuous internal assessment sheets, faculty allocations, and university marks cards leads to significant administrative latency, calculation errors, and transparency deficits. Traditional paper systems are incapable of providing instant academic alerts or audit-ready reports on demand.</p>
<p><b>CampusSync</b> is an advanced, automated Academic Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and Institutional Assessment System designed specifically to streamline collegiate administration. Developed using <b>Python (Flask)</b> and <b>MySQL</b>, the platform provides a unified digital ecosystem connecting college leadership, faculty members, and students.</p>
<p>The platform features a strict <b>Three-Tier Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)</b> architecture:</p>
<ol>
    <li><b>Administrative Governance:</b> College principals and examination controllers possess complete management over student enrollments, faculty allocations, subject syllabi, and official institutional performance reporting.</li>
    <li><b>University-Compliant Assessment Engine:</b> Directly tailored to Hemchandracharya North Gujarat University (HNGU) evaluation criteria, supporting automated best-of-two test averaging, attendance weightage, and granular practical evaluations (viva, coding, journal).</li>
    <li><b>Student Academic Transparency:</b> Students access personalized portals displaying real-time lecture attendance percentages (with statutory &lt;75% detention risk warnings) and verified internal mark cards.</li>
</ol>
<p>CampusSync eliminates manual calculation errors, reduces report generation turnaround by over 80%, and guarantees comprehensive statutory compliance with university academic ordinances.</p>
<div class="page-number-roman">Page iv</div>

