<!-- 11. SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS -->
<h1 class="page-break">SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS</h1>
<h2>11.1 Hardware Requirements</h2>
<p><b>Client Side:</b> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or higher, 2 GB RAM minimum, 100 MB free browser cache space, 1280 × 720 display resolution.<br/>
<b>Server Side:</b> Dual-Core 2.0 GHz or higher, 4 GB RAM minimum (8 GB recommended for production), 10 GB SSD storage, local network or internet connectivity.</p>

<h2>11.2 Software Requirements</h2>
<p>Windows 10 / 11, Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+), or macOS; Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, or Microsoft Edge; Python 3.10+; MySQL Server 8.0+; phpMyAdmin 5.2+; Visual Studio Code.</p>

<table>
    <thead>
