<!-- 13. DFD DIAGRAMS -->
<h1 class="page-break">DATA FLOW DIAGRAMS (DFD)</h1>
<p>Data Flow Diagrams visually represent how academic data enters CampusSync, moves between functional processes and storage entities, and generates outputs for end users.</p>

<h2>13.1 DFD Symbols & Notations</h2>
<div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 15pt; text-align: center;">
    <p><b>[ External Entity ]</b> — Rectangle representing external users (Admin, Faculty, Student)<br/>
    <b>( Process 0.0 )</b> — Circle or rounded shape representing a computation or function<br/>
    <b>[= Data Store =]</b> — Parallel lines representing database tables (D1, D2, etc.)<br/>
    <b>────────►</b> — Directed arrows indicating the flow of data</p>
</div>
<div class="caption">Figure 13.1: Standard DFD Symbols and Notations (Gane-Sarson / Yourdon)</div>

<h2>13.2 Context Analysis Diagram (DFD Level 0)</h2>
<div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; padding: 15pt; font-family: monospace; font-size: 10pt;">
<pre>
   [ Admin ] ──────── (Student/Faculty Master Data) ────────► ┌────────────────────┐
   [ Admin ] ◄─────── (Executive Master Report PDF, Matrix) ──┤                    │
                                                              │  0.0 CampusSync    │
   [ Faculty ] ────── (Daily Attendance, Internal Marks) ────►│  Academic ERP      │
   [ Faculty ] ◄───── (Allocated Subjects, Class Matrix) ─────┤  System            │
                                                              │                    │
   [ Student ] ────── (Login Request, Download Request) ─────►│                    │
   [ Student ] ◄───── (Attendance Status, Result Card PDF) ───└────────────────────┘
</pre>
</div>
<div class="caption">Figure 13.2: Context Analysis Diagram (DFD Level 0)</div>

<h2>13.3 Functional Decomposition (DFD Level 1)</h2>
<div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; padding: 15pt; font-family: monospace; font-size: 9pt;">
<pre>
 [Admin] ──► (1.0 Auth) ◄── [Faculty] ◄── [Student]
                 │
           [D1: Users]
                 │
 [Admin] ──► (2.0 Master Data) ◄──► [D2: Students] / [D3: Faculty] / [D4: Subjects]
                 │
 [Faculty] ─► (3.0 Attendance Monitoring) ◄──► [D5: Attendance Records]
                 │
 [Faculty] ─► (4.0 Internal Marks Evaluation) ◄──► [D6: Internal Marks]
                 │
 [Student] ◄─ (5.0 Result Processing &amp; Marksheet) ◄── [D6: Internal Marks]
                 │
 [Admin] ◄─── (6.0 Reporting &amp; Audit Engine) ◄── [D5: Attendance] &amp; [D6: Marks]
</pre>
</div>
<div class="caption">Figure 13.3: High-Level Functional Decomposition Diagram (DFD Level 1)</div>
